cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Source Kit – Open Provenance System"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-21
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - family-names: Bassetti-Blum
    given-names: Noah
abstract: >-
  The core of Source Kit, an iOS provenance camera: on-device C2PA
  Content Credentials signing, hardware-backed key custody with Apple
  App Attest binding, RFC 3161 and OpenTimestamps time anchoring, a
  pure-TypeScript X.509/COSE verification stack, and the test suite.
keywords:
  - provenance
  - C2PA
  - content credentials
  - content authenticity
  - cryptographic verification
  - digital forensics
  - App Attest
  - photojournalism
repository-code: "https://github.com/noah-pi/sourcekit-open"
url: "https://noah-pi.github.io/sourcekit-open/"
